            "detailed_description": "<strong>Super Night Riders</strong> é um jogo de corridas de sala de jogos moderno inspirado em clássicos retro.<br><br>És <i>Alice</i>, uma bela e talentosa motociclista conhecida como a motociclista vermelha.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.poster.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.webm?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.mp4?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Neste jogo, a tua posição na corrida não importa. Tem tudo a ver com o viajar o mais longe possível ao mesmo tempo que evitas os motociclistas rivais, e chegar a cada ponto de controlo antes do temporizador chegar a zero.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.poster.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.webm?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.mp4?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Todas as corridas começam durante o dia e continuam durante a noite fora até ao nascer do sol.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/1b560e8f0475e332fbd39045c4484ca8.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>O jogo tem dois tipos de estilos visuais: <i>Super</i> e <i>Classic</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ae205c96bb90706ba3ad943af01716b2.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=264 /></span><br><br>Percorre 36 etapas deslumbrantes em 6 percursos repletos de desafios!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/a241ef0f913da043776f3ff31375f092.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=340 /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Super Night Riders</strong> é um jogo de corridas de sala de jogos moderno inspirado em clássicos retro.<br><br>És <i>Alice</i>, uma bela e talentosa motociclista conhecida como a motociclista vermelha.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.poster.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.webm?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ccbd5511f2fe574ef951100555a3d909.mp4?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Neste jogo, a tua posição na corrida não importa. Tem tudo a ver com o viajar o mais longe possível ao mesmo tempo que evitas os motociclistas rivais, e chegar a cada ponto de controlo antes do temporizador chegar a zero.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.poster.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.webm?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/dd7c7519896303e521da09288064aed1.mp4?t=1769255244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Todas as corridas começam durante o dia e continuam durante a noite fora até ao nascer do sol.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/1b560e8f0475e332fbd39045c4484ca8.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>O jogo tem dois tipos de estilos visuais: <i>Super</i> e <i>Classic</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/ae205c96bb90706ba3ad943af01716b2.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=264 /></span><br><br>Percorre 36 etapas deslumbrantes em 6 percursos repletos de desafios!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444000/extras/a241ef0f913da043776f3ff31375f092.avif?t=1769255244\" width=640 height=340 /></span>",
